&_nc_oc=AdpJxO3Nv3G9k15DnKN_YWLOTNFh3EdSHDsi75l12G8yPNJgwgZINHJBPU90aIQA9tk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD49qsF2m16qt-5l7ZgzW8KpxWm1i2VF8ik8hNLJLUq9A&oe=6A6F26FE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sIN_vW5pS-UQ7kNvwEcypj4&_nc_oc=Adrxsk0rtv3ZzNb-m2xzfJJrNEBbtjk1tAegUSZtPsw9MXl7nn76SlsSJJGBtNJoP4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBywaINeSk7rH_prC5vF_GwrY0wR__eQP5v6EZ8ZUa32g&oe=6A6F37FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1euWobP9f-wQ7kNvwFsmtOy&_nc_oc=Adrv8Wb2g07yjNrTI9C8qVHosGPDL0-dSNCHOAbxCOeYAA01p5S2okZRnFU9uNeVJWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAM5hg9vFh3zFWiafIWla_oV1tDyWia5aSX0hAq-WfYyA&oe=6A6F5687"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I9KiTZOp5ekQ7kNvwFBjdbC&_nc_oc=AdrRPqSpQ93RjBY4dZ9bIQQd7a63WVK7Cg_ESI-OUpkMficgU5ohWMdykg1JxHjl3Ss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCwVdMoOgLM4Nyil0gocBfFtKteiCpvEyV7Cer5r5ZbSw&oe=6A6F4255"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oHkaBE1de58Q7kNvwHCYNUA&_nc_oc=AdqdsdS-4u_V-w-l8P7JS1g9rowKS645NohAlOnYr19mG8sRJjskwHqP4t2nRjTPMIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBGwB2yZQw4el-PHLjF2dtNcMKGSN8gff__G1jA9ChRmA&oe=6A6F4EE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.